**F2 — RESOLVED.** kinematics.ts:424-428 populates `engagedPreviousDepth = countedPasses(nearestCrossing − ½ rev)/4`, allocation-free; consumed at progression.ts:133 (CPU) and :286 (shader). Tests: kinematics.test.ts:346-387 cover all 10 spaces, passes 2-4, both crossing sides — uniform and shown depth equal (pass−1)/4; shaftRuntime.test.ts:246-265 recheck 781 runtime samples against an independent count, priors {1,2,3} covered.

