**Regression hunt — clean.** Chip anchor chipY=edgeY (kinematics.ts:494) is consistent with the corrected face; nothing assumed the old root. Ahead-of-edge depth counts cuts before the nearest crossing, never below the prior pass, and pass 1 ahead stays blank. The hold reuses the same constants as the certified path, so feed and envelope cannot diverge. The t<25 infeed override (shaftRuntime.ts:333-334) merely duplicates frame values with those constants. Legacy state ignores hob fields (mode pinned 'shaping', :329); thread geometry is still disposed once via the owned sets (:441).
